{"hookSpecificOutput":{"additionalContext":"<!-- edda:start -->\n## Workspace Context\n\n\n## Project (main)\n- head: main\n- branch: main\n- events: 1\n\n## Branch\n- name: main\n\n## Recent Commits (last 3)\n- (none)\n\n## Recent Merges (last 3)\n- (none)\n\n## Recent Signals (last 3)\n- (none)\n\n\n> Use edda_ask MCP tool or `edda ask <keyword>` for detailed decision history\n\n\n## Coordination Protocol\nYou are one of 2 agents working simultaneously.\n**Claim your scope** so peers know what you're working on:\n`edda claim \"<your-task>\" --paths \"<your-scope>/*\"`\nMessage a peer: `edda request \"peer-label\" \"your message\"`\nTo wake a peer now, use your host's cross-session messaging (target session id from `edda peers --json`).\n<!-- edda:end -->","hookEventName":"UserPromptSubmit"}}